  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial contribution for the Service for Restoration and Development of Infrastructure in the Dnipropetrovsk Oblast</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Finan&#x10D;n&#xFD; pr&#xED;spevok pre Service for Restoration and Development of Infrastructure in the Dnipropetrovsk Oblast</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Project for the construction of a main water pipeline, provided for by the Resolution of the Cabinet of Ministers of Ukraine No. 566 of June 6, 2023 and aimed at minimizing the consequences of an emergency situation related to the destruction of the Kakhovka hydroelectric plant and ensuring the livelihood of the population of Ukraine in conditions of a critical decrease in the water level in Kakhovsky Reservoir.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Projekt v&#xFD;stavby hlavn&#xE9;ho vodovodn&#xE9;ho potrubia, zabezpe&#x10D;en&#xFD; uznesen&#xED;m Kabinetu ministrov Ukrajiny &#x10D;. 566 zo 6. j&#xFA;na 2023 a zameran&#xFD; na minimaliz&#xE1;ciu n&#xE1;sledkov havarijnej situ&#xE1;cie s&#xFA;visiacej so zni&#x10D;en&#xED;m vodnej elektr&#xE1;rne Kakhovka a zabezpe&#x10D;enie &#x17E;ivobytia obyvate&#x13E;ov Ukrajiny v podmienkach kritick&#xE9;ho poklesu hladiny vody v Kakhovskej priehrade.</narrative>
  </description>
